# NestedText v3 - office/ per-folder DETAIL pass (measured 2026-09-16)
# Source: cc-resources/.dtd-file-examples/office/ - 27 files, 231.5 KB.
# OpenOffice.org era, Apache 2.0. Completes the office+dtds+daisy trio
# beside office-dtds-daisy.nt (listing) with the office detail.

folder-shape:
    drivers: 12 .dtd, one per application part (menubar, toolbar, statusbar, dialog, Manifest, libraries, image, event, groupuinames, accelerator, module, office)
    features: 15 .mod (chart datastyl defs drawing dtypes event form image meta module nmspace office script settings style table text)
    namespaces: menu form meta and more, fixed xmlns per element (menu:id CDATA REQUIRED beside xmlns:menu CDATA FIXED)
    param-models: form.mod declares controls as form:text|textarea|fixed-text|file|password|formatted-text|button|image, content models as entities

per-app-drivers-shared-mods:
    > Twelve drivers, fifteen feature modules: each application part
    > declares its root and pulls the features it needs. Namespaces are
    > fixed per element, never prefixed by convention: menu:id REQUIRED
    > with xmlns:menu FIXED side by side, identity and location in one tag.

release-binding:
    > Stream 17 (audit legs): twelve drivers over shared features is the
    > closest precedent for one audit leg per family over shared checkers;
    > the leg names the driver, the features ride along.
    > Stream 4 (precedence): FIXED namespace URIs beside REQUIRED ids are
    > identity resolved in place, the catalog discipline without a catalog.
